  "caption": "Hong Kong indie band pop in the 2025 local band wave, a four-piece playing live in one room. Two clean electric guitars, one chiming bright arpeggios high on the neck and one chopping off-beat chords; a melodic picked electric bass walking up to each chorus; live drums with a busy sixteenth hi-hat and quick snare fills; a Wurlitzer electric piano holding the chords. Live-room band sound, guitars panned left and right, bass up front, very little reverb. Male light tenor, conversational in the verses, lifting into falsetto on the chorus, the band joining as a gang vocal on the last chorus. 132 BPM, D major. Sweaty, wry and loyal. No pop-punk power chords, no stadium rock guitar solo, no synth pads, no autotune, no ballad tempo drop.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n八月 深水埗 劏房一百呎\n四個人圍住 一個電磁爐\n阿Ken帶咗肥牛 阿傑帶咗魚蛋\n我開冷氣 個湯啱啱滾\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n啪 一聲 成間屋黑晒\n大家喺度 摸住條筷子\n\n[Chorus]\n又跳掣 又跳掣\n冷氣同火鍋 只可以揀一樣\n又跳掣 又跳掣\n四個人摸黑 笑到肚痛\n\n[Verse]\n熄冷氣 先開爐\n汗流到落埋 個湯度\n阿傑除咗衫 阿Ken撥住扇\n魚蛋浮起 我哋搶到打交\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n熄爐 開返冷氣\n啪 又一聲 唔知邊個撳錯\n\n[Chorus]\n又跳掣 又跳掣\n電錶箱喺門口 我行咗十轉\n又跳掣 又跳掣\n樓上阿伯 敲門問我哋搞乜\n\n[Bridge]\n最後拎個爐 出去後樓梯\n四個人坐喺石級 夜風都係熱嘅\n\n[Chorus]\n又跳掣 又跳掣\n後樓梯嘅火鍋 原來最好食\n又跳掣 下個月再嚟\n記住帶多 一把扇\n\n[Outro]\n啪 一聲 再嚟過",
